{
  "name": "blast-plan-save-load-visual",
  "description": "Saved games redraw the blast plan overlay (#1877). The player drills and charges a 3x3 pattern at (36,32), saves to slot_1 through the Saves modal, orders a second 3x3 plan at (48,32), loads slot_1 through the Saves modal, then clicks a hole marker and the hole inspector opens. The second plan's ids are gone. Waits are on conditions, never delays.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "command": "new_game mine_type:desert seed:42 staffed:true cash:500000",
      "role": "setup",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "new_game mine_type:desert seed:42 staffed:true cash:500000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 500000,
          "buildingCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "drill_plan grid rows:3 cols:3 spacing:3 depth:8 start:36,32 diameter:0.089",
      "description": "#1877: order the first 3x3 pattern at (36,32); ids H1-H9.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickIfPresent",
          "selector": "#bs-inspector [data-panel-close]",
          "timeoutMs": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-toolbar [data-panel=\"blast\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"grid-tool\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "setStepper",
          "selector": "#bs-param-strip [data-field=\"depth\"]",
          "value": 8
        },
        {
          "type": "setStepper",
          "selector": "#bs-param-strip [data-field=\"spacing\"]",
          "value": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "dragTiles",
          "x1": 36,
          "z1": 32,
          "x2": 42,
          "z2": 38
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "orderedHoleCount": 9,
          "holeCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:holeCount equals:9 max_ticks:220",
      "description": "#553: drain the ordered plan -- the staffed driller/drill_rig lands all 9 holes well inside this budget (sandbox-measured landing at tick 166 under real, un-cheated needs gauges).",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "holeCount",
          "equals": 9,
          "maxTicks": 220,
          "timeoutMs": 60000
        }
      ],
      "timeout": 90,
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "orderedHoleCount": 0,
          "holeCount": 9
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "charge hole:* explosive:boomite amount:6 stemming:2",
      "description": "#1774: 6 kg breakout charge (BURDEN_BREAKOUT_MAX, balance.ts) -- the 5 kg shot left the rubble sealed under the cap, and sealed rock gets no haul/fragment order, so collectedOreTotal never rose. Amount is set through its stepper so interaction mode charges the same 6 kg; stemming 2 matches DEFAULT_STEMMING_M (Charge.ts).",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "setStepper",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"amount\"]",
          "value": 6
        },
        {
          "type": "setStepper",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-field=\"stemming\"]",
          "value": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"charge-all\"]"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "increased": [
          "orderedChargeCount"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:orderedChargeCount equals:0 max_ticks:3000",
      "description": "#554: drain the charge order(s) queued by the step above (charging is real work, not instant) before continuing.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "orderedChargeCount",
          "equals": 0,
          "maxTicks": 3000,
          "timeoutMs": 120000
        }
      ],
      "timeout": 125,
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "chargedCount": 9,
          "orderedChargeCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:wetHoleCount equals:0 max_ticks:300",
      "description": "#1801: rest-completion morale shifts the crew's pace and so the weather at blast time. Boomite is water-sensitive: a wet hole fizzles and the shot no longer breaks out (measured: 9 wet holes at tick 233, none at tick 251). Waiting for the holes to dry is what a player does; blasting is unchanged.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "wetHoleCount",
          "equals": 0,
          "maxTicks": 300,
          "timeoutMs": 60000
        }
      ],
      "timeout": 65,
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "wetHoleCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "save slot:slot_1",
      "description": "#1877: save the drilled and charged pattern to slot_1 through the Saves modal. Command mode stand-in is a read-only status.",
      "timeout": 60,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-saveload-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "awaitUsable",
          "selector": "#bs-saves-modal [data-slot=\"slot_1\"] [data-action=\"save-here\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-saves-modal [data-slot=\"slot_1\"] [data-action=\"save-here\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForProperty",
          "selector": "#bs-saves-modal",
          "property": "clientHeight",
          "expectedValue": 0
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "changedBy": {
          "cash": 0
        },
        "blocked": "#bs-saves-modal"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "drill_plan grid rows:3 cols:3 spacing:3 depth:8 start:48,32 diameter:0.089 confirm:true",
      "description": "#1877: order a second 3x3 pattern at (48,32) (ids H10-H18, ordered ghosts only). A later load of slot_1 must not leave these markers drawn. Replacing the drilled plan asks first (#1345): the confirm modal's Replace button is clicked, command mode passes confirm:true.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickIfPresent",
          "selector": "#bs-inspector [data-panel-close]",
          "timeoutMs": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "ensurePanel",
          "panel": "blast"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"grid-tool\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "setStepper",
          "selector": "#bs-param-strip [data-field=\"depth\"]",
          "value": 8
        },
        {
          "type": "setStepper",
          "selector": "#bs-param-strip [data-field=\"spacing\"]",
          "value": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "dragTiles",
          "x1": 48,
          "z1": 32,
          "x2": 54,
          "z2": 38
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": ".bs-confirm-overlay [data-action=\"confirm-yes\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": ".bs-confirm-overlay [data-action=\"confirm-yes\"]"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "orderedHoleCount": 9,
          "holeCount": 0,
          "chargedCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "load slot:slot_1",
      "description": "#1877: load slot_1 in the same page through the Saves modal. The loaded state has 9 charged holes and no second plan; the overlay must be redrawn from it.",
      "timeout": 60,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-saveload-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "awaitUsable",
          "selector": "#bs-saves-modal [data-slot=\"slot_1\"] [data-action=\"load\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-saves-modal [data-slot=\"slot_1\"] [data-action=\"load\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": ".bs-confirm-overlay [data-action=\"confirm-yes\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": ".bs-confirm-overlay [data-action=\"confirm-yes\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForProperty",
          "selector": "#bs-saves-modal",
          "property": "clientHeight",
          "expectedValue": 0
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "blocked": "#bs-saves-modal",
        "equals": {
          "orderedHoleCount": 0,
          "holeCount": 9,
          "chargedCount": 9
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "fragments status",
      "description": "#1877: after the load a player clicks the centre hole (H5) of the loaded pattern by its marker and the hole inspector opens. Before the fix the overlay kept the old game's markers (or none on a fresh page), so the click found no hole to hit.",
      "timeout": 60,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickIfPresent",
          "selector": "#bs-inspector [data-panel-close]",
          "timeoutMs": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "clickEntity",
          "kind": "hole",
          "id": 5,
          "distance": 8
        },
        {
          "type": "awaitUsable",
          "selector": "#bs-inspector[data-kind=\"hole\"][data-id=\"5\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "usable": "#bs-inspector[data-kind=\"hole\"][data-id=\"5\"]",
        "note": "a hole drawn from the loaded state is clickable and inspectable"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "fragments status",
      "description": "#1877: the second plan's hole H14 no longer exists after the load; nothing of it is inspectable.",
      "role": "observe",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "blocked": "#bs-inspector[data-id=\"14\"]",
        "equals": {
          "orderedHoleCount": 0
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
